      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        210,
        752,
        1516,
        830
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, New Yorkers face a crisis of affordability, and nobody should be stuck paying for a subscription they do not want; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2578,
          "min": -1.4075
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0017,
          "min": -0.0431
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3618,
        "area_px": 101673,
        "density": 0.03558,
        "chars": 127,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 35.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        208,
        868,
        1516,
        947
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, businesses too often deceptively enroll people into subscriptions and unfairly keep them stuck there, including through making it difficult to cancel; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1856,
          "min": -0.9135
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 29,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0337
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5346,
        "area_px": 101831,
        "density": 0.0525,
        "chars": 163,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 30.49
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        208,
        983,
        1516,
        1099
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, as a matter of basic fairness and honest business practice, New Yorkers deserve to freely decide which products and services they want to enroll in and which products and services they no longer want; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1428,
          "min": -1.1654
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 40,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.012
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6237,
        "area_px": 150813,
        "density": 0.04136,
        "chars": 213,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 34.15
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        206,
        1137,
        1516,
        1289
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, subscription tricks and traps conceal or misrepresent the price of a subscription or the terms of a subscription from consumers, thereby burdening consumers with subscriptions they did not intend to purchase and for terms that consumers did not intend to agree to; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1455,
          "min": -0.9193
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 50,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0111
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 8079,
        "area_px": 197523,
        "density": 0.0409,
        "chars": 277,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 34.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        206,
        1329,
        1516,
        1408
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, honest businesses that do not use subscription tricks and traps are at a competitive disadvantage and are economically undermined when bad actors use these tactics; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1421,
          "min": -0.8693
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0005,
          "min": -0.0129
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4544,
        "area_px": 103280,
        "density": 0.044,
        "chars": 177,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 38.95
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204,
        1446,
        1516,
        1564
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, taking action against subscription tricks and traps protects consumers, promotes trust in the marketplace, and rewards businesses that compete by offering real value rather than relying on dishonest business practices; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1322,
          "min": -0.9802
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1911,
        "area_px": 152456,
        "density": 0.01253,
        "chars": 231,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 120.88
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204,
        1602,
        1516,
        1716
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHERAS, the New York City Department of Consumer and Worker Protection is responsible for enforcing the City's Consumer Protection Law and City rules enacted to combat deceptive business practices; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1336,
          "min": -1.1836
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 35,
          "mean": -0.0059,
          "min": -0.1519
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1883,
        "area_px": 147288,
        "density": 0.01278,
        "chars": 201,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 106.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        202,
        1754,
        1516,
        1872
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City will deploy its full tools and authorities to protect New Yorkers from underhanded business tactics that rip them off or cause financial harm and to protect honest businesses from unfair competition;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1156,
          "min": -0.8955
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
